#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Apply The Styles Above To The Front-end Editor"
msgstr "把以上風格套用到前台編輯器"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Off (default): the front-end comment editor keeps the default light style and follows your theme — write your own CSS if you need e.g. a dark mode. On: the two styles above apply to the front-end editor as well. The admin editor is never affected by this switch."
msgstr "關閉（預設）：前台留言編輯器使用 Editor.md 內建的淺色樣式、跟隨你的佈景主題 —— 需要夜間模式等效果請自行撰寫 CSS。開啟：以上兩項風格同樣套用到前台編輯器。後台編輯器不受本開關影響。"

