#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Use Simple Editor For Front Comments"
msgstr "訪客留言使用簡版編輯器"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Offers only bold, italic, strikethrough, blockquote, inline code, images and links in the visitor comment box — links and images are not clickable. The editor starts in single-column mode with a trimmed toolbar."
msgstr "訪客留言區只提供粗體、斜體、刪除線、引用、行內程式碼、圖片與連結（連結與圖片不可點擊），編輯器預設單欄、工具列精簡。"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Comment Syntax Limitation"
msgstr "留言語法的限制"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Comment syntax is limited by the WordPress KSES whitelist for untrusted content. Whether or not the simple editor is enabled, images, tables, headings, lists and horizontal rules may not display correctly in comments — some are stripped outright. The currently effective whitelist is listed under “Advanced Settings → Debugger”."
msgstr "留言區可用的語法受 WordPress 對不可信內容的 KSES 白名單限制。無論是否開啟簡版編輯器，圖片、表格、多級標題、列表、分隔線等在留言區的顯示都可能受限（部分會被直接剝除）。目前實際生效的白名單見「進階設定 → 偵錯資訊」。"

#: src/Front/FrontEditor.php
msgid "Supports **bold**, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~, > quote, `code`, images and links (links and images are not clickable)"
msgstr "支援 **粗體**、*斜體*、~~刪除線~~、> 引用、`程式碼`、圖片與連結（連結與圖片不可點擊）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Comment HTML Whitelist (KSES)"
msgstr "留言區允許的 HTML 標籤（KSES）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Comment Behavior Added By This Plugin"
msgstr "本外掛對留言區新增的行為（非 WordPress 原生支援）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "(unavailable on this site)"
msgstr "（本站不可用）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "(no attribute)"
msgstr "（無屬性）"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "[WordPress native]"
msgstr "［WordPress 原生］"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "[added by this plugin]"
msgstr "［本外掛擴充］"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "enabled"
msgstr "已開啟"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "已關閉"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Images: WordPress does not allow <img> inside comments natively; this plugin adds it to the whitelist above. Current state: %s"
msgstr "圖片：WordPress 原生不允許留言內嵌 <img>，是本外掛把它加進了上面的白名單（非原生支援）。目前狀態：%s"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Links: external links inside comments are degraded to read-only text and no <a> tag is produced. Current state: %s"
msgstr "連結：留言內的外部連結會被降級為唯讀文字，不產生 <a> 標籤。目前狀態：%s"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Degraded link output template: %s"
msgstr "連結降級後的輸出範本：%s"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Comment body wrapper (%1$s) scopes image width and turns off emoji shortcodes inside comments. Current state: %2$s"
msgstr "留言正文容器（%1$s）：用於約束圖片寬度，並關閉留言區的 emoji 短代碼。目前狀態：%2$s"

#: src/Utils/Debugger.php
msgid "Formulas / task lists / code blocks / emoji inside comments are turned off. Current state: %s"
msgstr "留言區的公式 / 任務清單 / 程式碼區塊 / emoji 已關閉。目前狀態：%s"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "Currently confirmed to be fully compatible with the WordPress default themes. If it fails to load, please report it as soon as possible."
msgstr "目前已確認與 WordPress 預設主題完全相容，若載入失敗請及時回饋！"

#: src/Utils/Settings.php
msgid "I am the author of this modified / forked version. Compared with the original author's contribution, all I did was some minor fixes and small tweaks with little technical merit, so I did not add my own donation info. If you enjoy this modified WP-Editor.md, it would be great if you could visit my blog <a href=\"https://www.tjsky.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">秋风于渭水</a> when you have time. Thank you!"
msgstr "我是二次開發修改版的作者：和原作者的貢獻比起來，我只是做了些沒什麼技術含量的小修小改，就不留捐贈資訊了，如果修改版 WP-Editor.md 能得到你的喜愛，有空來看看我的部落格《<a href=\"https://www.tjsky.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">秋风于渭水</a>》就好啦，謝謝！"
